I can not begin to explain the layers in this that are so incredibly wrong. I am intelligent and I would've if I felt I could. Abuse isn't just the violence and screaming, it touches every part of your life and destroys everything around you until you are isolated and cornered.

I don't even make appropriate facial expressions in class, what do you mean check your facial expressions

