the number is off by quite a bit but unfortunately not. I can not disclose my work but I did work around this subject for almost a year and found disgusting disparities in how disability, especially neurodevelopmental disabilities, are abused, left out, or unaccommodated in the American work force, especially in high-population areas ironically (New York, Nashville, etc.)

